{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S11等较短段落中感受词仍然偏密，纵向交替阅读容易来不及消化；Y的左右分栏更容易快速定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用放大加亮的关键词把每段叙事的转折和核心矛盾直接呈现出来，观众容易抓住舍不得、受过的气、渴望亲近与不敢回头之间的拉扯。感受词按照音乐进程出现，舞步、旧歌、呼吸、停顿等细节也让心理变化与音乐变化彼此呼应，前后更有连续性，情感层次更细。Y的左右分栏确实更容易扫读，完整句子的因果关系也比较顺畅，但部分音乐和情绪变化被压缩成静态短词，细腻程度和过程感不及X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "49a618fb-3841-47f2-af3c-52e3cfa13300", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022707580278Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:28:06.647297+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cc2f6f3df8e56b6bd0688a4e07d87c7c3a6b974718baa830a3bc2b458049fe4b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at